### ============================================================
### G10 - API Gateway & Securite
### Architecture adaptee : G3 est source de verite utilisateurs/JWT.
### G10 valide le JWT, controle les roles, route vers G1-G9.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userToken = COLLER_ACCESS_TOKEN_G3_ROLE_USER
@adminToken = COLLER_ACCESS_TOKEN_G3_ROLE_ADMIN
@agentToken = COLLER_ACCESS_TOKEN_G3_ROLE_AGENT


### Health G10
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health


### Swagger G10
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html


### Auth G3 routee par G10 - login
### G10 ne traite pas le mot de passe. Il route vers G3.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@sgitu.ma",
  "password": "Password123"
}


### Auth G3 routee par G10 - register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.user@sgitu.ma",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "ROLE_USER"
}


### Auth G3 routee par G10 - verify email
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email?token=COLLER_TOKEN_G3


### Auth G3 routee par G10 - forgot password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@sgitu.ma"
}


### Auth G3 routee par G10 - reset password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "COLLER_RESET_TOKEN_G3",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123"
}


### Auth G3 routee par G10 - refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "COLLER_REFRESH_TOKEN_G3"
}


### 401 - route protegee sans JWT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/1


### 401 - route protegee avec JWT invalide
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer token-invalide
X-Correlation-Id: test-invalid-token


### 404 - JWT valide mais route inconnue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/unknown/test
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-404


### 403 - ROLE_USER interdit sur endpoint admin G3 route par G10
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-403-admin-users


### Admin G3 route par G10 - lister comptes utilisateurs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-admin-users


### Admin G3 route par G10 - changer role
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/1/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-admin-role

{
  "role": "ROLE_OPERATOR"
}


### Routage G1 Billetterie - details ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g1


### Routage G1 Billetterie - admin dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g1-admin


### Routage G2 Abonnements
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/abonnements/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g2


### Routage G2 Admin - suspendre abonnement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/abonnements/admin/1/suspendre?motif=test
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g2-admin


### Routage G3 Utilisateurs - profil
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g3


### Routage G4 Coordination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/g4/health
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g4


### Routage G5 Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g5


### Routage G6 Paiement
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g6


### Routage G7 Suivi Vehicules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/suivi-vehicules/health
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g7


### Routage G8 Ingestion - tickets
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingestion/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-g8-ingestion-tickets

{
  "ticketId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "eventType": "TICKET_CREATED",
  "amount": 6.0
}


### Routage G8 Analytics - dashboard admin/agent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g8-dashboard


### Routage G8 ML - prediction peak hours admin/agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/predict/peak-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-g8-predict-peak-hours

{
  "horizonHours": 24
}


### Routage G9 Incidents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/test
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-g9
